GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT


Kingdom of Josh the gentle (#3):
  In early summer, an army coming from the empire of 
Josh the gentle Sevenhalf-eight (#3) entered Hindu Kush, hoping to conquer 
that province ruled by the provincial Eagle chieftain and made up of great 
Mountains.  Josh the gentle commanded the attacking armies.  The defenders 
were commanded by the provincial Eagle chieftain.  Hindu Kush was overrun by 
Josh the gentle's men in a hard-fought campaign.

  In fall, a host of warriors carried the banner of 
Josh the gentle Sevenhalf-eight into the Desert province of Takla Makan, 
held by the provincial Dragon chieftain.  Josh the gentle commanded the 
attacking armies.  The defenders were commanded by the provincial Dragon 
chieftain.  Takla Makan was overrun by the forces of Josh the gentle.


